Server init.

>> message := ['this is a string to be encrypted!'].
>> key := ['secret123!'].
>> vault := Polokelo-e-sireletsehileng ncha: ['myvault'].

>> encrypted := vault pata: message senotlolo: key.
>> decrypted := vault senola: encrypted senotlolo: key.

Sephetho 
ngola: ['Message:'], mola-o-mocha
ngola: message, mola-o-mocha
ngola: ['Decrypted:'], mola-o-mocha
ngola: decrypted, mola-o-mocha.
